    { "type": "subheading", "text": "Now for the story..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "One day John heard the fish were biting so he decided he would go fishing. He told his family where he was going and when he planned on returning home. He grabbed his favorite fishing gear, hooked up his boat to his truck, and headed to the lake. After he got to the lake, he put his boat in the water and headed to his favorite fishing spot. The fish were biting and John was having a good time just relaxing and enjoying the day." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Then John noticed that the sky was getting darker, and it started to rain so he packed up his fishing gear and headed back to the boat ramp. On his way back, the wind started blowing very hard so he decided to pull into a cove." },
